   "source": [
    "# 07 - Project Summary & Dashboard\n",
    "\n",
    "**Residue Manifold Learning (RML) + CGCS for Trisomy 21**  \n",
    "**Allen Lab Collaboration Overview**"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ================================================\n",
    "# SETUP\n",
    "# ================================================\n",
    "import sys\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "if \"/content/allen-lab-report-tool\" not in str(Path.cwd()):\n",
    "    repo_path = \"/content/allen-lab-report-tool\"\n",
    "    if Path(repo_path).exists():\n",
    "        %cd /content/allen-lab-report-tool\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        print(\"Cloning repo...\")\n",
    "        !git clone https://github.com/thinkthoughts/allen-lab-report-tool.git\n",
    "        %cd allen-lab-report-tool\n",
    "\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, str(Path.cwd() / \"src\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "import grok\n",
    "from grok.trisomy_metrics import trisomy_cgcs_score, simulate_intervention_recovery\n",
    "from grok.visualization import plot_cgcs_vs_noise, plot_dosage_impact\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Project Dashboard Ready\")\n",
    "print(f\"Version: {grok.__version__}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Project Overview"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"\"\"\
Residue Manifold Learning (RML) + Constraint-Guided Coherence Score (CGCS)
=======================================================================
    
Goal: Quantify chromosomal dosage noise and coherence recovery in Trisomy 21
Target: Complement Allen Lab transcriptional dysregulation research
    \"\"\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Core CGCS Comparison Dashboard"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "scenarios = {\n",
    "    \"Normal (Euploid)\": trisomy_cgcs_score(1.0)['cgcs'],\n",
    "    \"Typical Trisomy 21\": trisomy_cgcs_score(1.5, 0.5, 0.4)['cgcs'],\n",
    "    \"High Dysregulation\": trisomy_cgcs_score(1.5, 0.8, 0.6)['cgcs'],\n",
    "    \"Mild Mosaic\": trisomy_cgcs_score(1.3, 0.3, 0.2)['cgcs']\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "df = pd.DataFrame.from_dict(scenarios, orient='index', columns=['CGCS'])\n",
    "df = df.round(4)\n",
    "display(df)\n",
    "\n",
    "plot_dosage_impact()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Intervention Recovery Potential"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "baseline = trisomy_cgcs_score(1.5, 0.5, 0.4)['cgcs']\n",
    "\n",
    "interventions = {\n",
    "    \"Early Therapies\": 0.35,\n",
    "    \"Pharmacological Targeting\": 0.45,\n",
    "    \"Combined Approach\": 0.60\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "for name, strength in interventions.items():\n",
    "    recovered = simulate_intervention_recovery(baseline, strength)\n",
    "    print(f\"{name:25} → {recovered:.4f}  (+{recovered-baseline:.4f})\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Key Strengths of This Framework"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- Grounded in discrete modular mathematics (modular residue lanes)\n",
    "- Multiplicative coherence metric sensitive to dosage noise\n",
    "- Models both disruption (extra chromosome) and recovery (interventions)\n",
    "- Captures person-to-person variability\n",
    "- Directly applicable to transcriptomic data\n",
    "- Open source and extensible"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Next Steps for Allen Lab Collaboration"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. Apply CGCS to real Allen Lab RNA-seq / GRO-seq datasets\n",
    "2. Test on person-to-person variability samples\n",
    "3. Model specific gene targets (DYRK1A, APP, etc.)\n",
    "4. Joint white paper / grant section\n",
    "5. Expand residue encoding to full codon or regulatory regions"
   ]
  }
